senses.gloss:
सं-√ दह् P. Ā. -दहति, ˚ते, to burn together, burn up, consume by fire, destroy utterly, RV. &c. &c.;
 (Ā.) to be burnt up, be consumed, MW. :
Pass. -दह्यते, to be burnt up, TS.;
to burn, glow, BhP.;
to be distressed or grieved, pine away, Ragh. :
Caus. -दाहयति, to cause to burn up, MBh. :
Desid. See सं-दिधक्षु.

सं-√ दा P. Ā. -ददाति, -दत्ते, to give together, present, grant, bestow, RV.; AV.;
to hold together, AV.;
 (Ā. or Pass.) to meet, RV. i, 139, 1; iv, 44, 5.

सं-√ दिश् P. -दिशति (ind.p. -दिश्य, q.v.), to point out, appoint, assign, R.; Bhaṭṭ.;
to state, tell, direct, command, give an order or message to (gen. or dat., sometimes two acc.; with अभि-दूति, ‘to a female messenger’), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to despatch any one (acc.) on a message to (dat.), Kum. :
Caus. -देशयति, to cause to point out or declare, invite or ask to speak about, MBh.

सं-√ दिह् P. -देग्धि, to smear, besmear, cover, Kauś.; MBh. &c.;
to heap together, MW.;
 Ā. -दिग्धे (pr. p. -दिहान, or -देहमान), to be doubtful or uncertain (said of persons and things), Kāv.; Śaṃk. :
Pass. -दिह्यते, to be smeared over or covered, be confused, confounded with (instr.), Nir. ii, 7 ;
 be indistinct or doubtful or uncertain, MBh.; Kāv. &c.:
Caus. -देहयति, to make indistinct or uncertain, confuse, perplex, MBh.;
 (Ā.) to be doubtful or uncertain (in सं-देहयान v.l. -देहमान), ib.

सं-√ दीप् Ā. -दीप्यते (ep. also ˚ति), to blaze up, flame, burn, glow, Hariv. :
Caus. -दीपयति, to set on fire, kindle, inflame, RV., &c.;
to fire, animate, MBh.; BhP.

सं-√ दुष् P. -दुष्यति, to become utterly corrupt or polluted or unclean, MBh. :
Caus. -दूषयति (ind.p. -दूष्य), to corrupt, vitiate, defile, stain, spoil, R.; Suśr.; Rājat.;
to revile, abuse, censure, expose to shame or infamy, MBh.; Kām.

सं-√ दुह् P. Ā. -दोग्धि, -दुग्धे, to milk together or at the same time, MBh.;
 (Ā.) to suck, imbibe, enjoy, RV. ix, 18, 5;
 (Ā.) to yield (as milk &c.), AV. :
Caus. -दोहयति (ind.p. -दोह्य), to cause to milk &c., ŚBr.

सं-√ दृश् P. Ā. (only in non-conj. tenses, e.g. pf. -ददर्श, -ददृशे fut. -द्रक्ष्यति, ˚ते; ind.p. -दृश्य; inf. -द्रष्टुम्, Ved. -दृशे; cf. सम्-√ पश्),
to see together or at the same time, see well or completely, behold, view, perceive, observe, consider, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
 (Ā. and Pass. -दृश्यते), to be seen at the same time, appear together with (instr.), RV.; ŚBr.;
to look like, resemble, be similar or equal, RV.;
to be observed, become visible, appear, MBh.; Kāv. &c.:
Caus. -दर्शयति, to cause to be seen, display, show, feign (आत्मानम् मृत-वत् सं-द्˚, ‘to feign one's self dead’), ib.;
to represent, Gīt.; Rājat.;
to expose, explain, Divyāv.;
to show one's self to (acc.), MBh.; R. :
Desid. of Caus. See सं-दिदर्शयिषु:
Desid. See सं-दिदृक्षु.
